      "line": "what the price implies",
      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "At ₹4,680 (NSE close, 23 Nov 2026), the reinvestment-phase discounted cash flow model (Template B, since TITAN's median return on invested capital of 26.7% is above its 11.01% cost of capital) matches the price if revenue grows about 42.6% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 8.6%; TITAN's revenue grew 32.1% a year over FY22–FY26.",
