      "text": "With the other assumptions at base, the valuation is most sensitive to the operating margin (two percentage points either way: a model value of ₹1,826 to ₹3,755 a share) and to the cost of capital (one percentage point either way: a model value of ₹2,174 to ₹3,674 a share); the Q3 FY27 result will be the next reported quarter.",
